      "subject": "ka a kɔgɔn",
      "rationale": "ויעל (vaya'al) kɔrɔ tiɲɛ ye 'ka san' (go up) ye — o ye sira kɔrɔlen ye min bɛ taa Yerushalayim (Jerusalem) la, ani a bɛ fɔ ko 'lève-toi' (arise)."
